name: telecom-payment-ring
label: Top-up ring (shared payment)
category: telecom
description: A line that shares top-up evidence (the same voucher, card or agent) with two or more other lines, and those lines lead back to it. Rogue agents and cloned vouchers show up this way. Shared-payment links run both ways, so the closing step confirms the ring rather than narrowing it.
stages[2]{shape,minBranches,edgeKind,nodeKind,windowHours,afterPrevious,maxGapHours,thresholdAttr,thresholdMin,thresholdMax,closesToStart}:
  fan-out,2,shared_payment,"",0,false,0,"","","",false
  fan-in,2,shared_payment,"",0,false,0,"","","",true
